  "solution": "**Given:- ** \n\n44 + 67 - 32 ÷ 4 + (9 + 5 + 5 + 4) - 4 × 12 ÷ 6 - 30 ÷ 5\n\n**Concept used:- **\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation:- **\n\nLet's solve the expression step by step\n\n⇒ 44 + 67 - 32 ÷ 4 + (9 + 5 + 5 + 4) - 4 × 12 ÷ 6 - 30 ÷ 5\n\n⇒ 44 + 67 - 32 ÷ 4 + (23) - 4 × 12 ÷ 6 - 30 ÷ 5\n\n⇒ 44 + 67 - 8 + 23 - 8 - 6\n\n⇒111 - 8 + 23 - 8 - 6\n\n⇒ 103 + 23 - 8 - 6\n\n⇒126 - 8 - 6 = 112\n\n**∴ The expression value is 112. **",
